"""altix - drive the SGI Altix 350 test box end to end.

L2 control (power/reset/arbitrary L2 commands), a persistent system-console
logger, IST tools (errdmp/mmr_dump) on the L3, and boot-cycle orchestration.
See README.md in this directory.

All settings come from the environment (see CONFIG below); defaults match the
current lab setup: software L2 running on l3.ad.nsafran.com, target "pople".
"""

